{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2023-05-15 18:09:00', 'title': 'ONSEMI AND SINENG ELECTRIC SPEARHEAD THE DEVELOPMENT OF SUSTAINABLE ENERGY APPLICATIONS', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ONSEMI (NASDAQ: ON), A LEADER IN INTELLIGENT POWER AND SENSING TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SINENG ELECTRIC WILL INTEGRATE ONSEMI ELITESIC SILICON CARBIDE (SIC) MOSFETS AND IGBT-BASED HIGH-DENSITY POWER INTEGRATED MODULES (PIMS) INTO ITS UTILITY-SCALE SOLAR INVERTER AND INDUSTRY-FIRST 200KW ENERGY STORAGE SYSTEM (ESS). THE TWO COMPANIES WORKED TOGETHER TO DEVELOP OPTIMIZED SOLUTIONS THAT MAXIMIZE THE PERFORMANCE OF SOLAR INVERTERS, ENERGY STORAGE AND PO.'}